msgid "Adjust anti-aliasing: 0 off 1 fxaa 2 smaa 3 taa 4 fsr 5 dlss."
msgstr "设置抗锯齿：0 关闭、1 FXAA、2 SMAA、3 TAA、4 FSR、5 DLSS。"

msgid "Internal rendering resolution relative to the window."
msgstr "内部渲染分辨率相对于窗口的比例。"

msgid "Keep textures sharp when viewed at an angle."
msgstr "斜角观看时保持贴图清晰。"

msgid "Choose which parts of the scene appear in reflections."
msgstr "选择哪些场景内容会出现在反射中。"

msgid "Scale the number of grass instances drawn."
msgstr "调整绘制出的草丛数量倍率。"

msgid "Rendering resolution for rain, dust and other weather particles."
