msgid "All fixes"
msgstr "全部修复"

msgid "Every bug on this page as the game ships it, or every fix."
msgstr "本页所有问题都按游戏原样，或全部修复。"

msgid "Raids as written"
msgstr "袭击按原始数据"

msgid "Raid and campaign data that builds on a base campaign counts the base's squads and follow-up campaigns once. The game counts them twice, so inherited squads come up more often and follow-up raids are about twice as likely."
msgstr "袭击与战役数据建立在基础战役之上时，会把基础战役的所有小队和后续袭击都只计算一次。游戏会计算两次，导致继承来的小队出现得更频繁，后续袭击的概率也约翻倍。"

msgid "Door break sound"
msgstr "门被撞破的音效"

msgid "Doors and gates make their breaking sound when they are bashed or broken open. The game never picks which breaking sound to play, so it plays none."
msgstr "门和门闸在遭到撞击或被强行打开时会发出破坏音效。游戏从不挑选该播放哪段破坏音效，于是什么也不播放。"

msgid "Ambience after loading"
msgstr "载入后的环境音"

msgid "A biome whose sounds were not loaded yet starts its day or night ambience by the time of day. The game plays the opposite one (night sounds by day) until the next biome or day change."
msgstr "声音尚未载入的生物群系，会按当前时段开始播放白天或夜间的环境音。在切换到下一个生物群系或时段变化之前，游戏会播放相反的一套（白天放夜间的音效）。"

msgid "Wind stops"
msgstr "风声停止"

msgid "The wind's sound ends when the wind dies down. The game asks for a stop sound that does not exist, so once the wind has blown it never goes quiet."
msgstr "风变小的时候风声会结束。游戏请求播放一段并不存在的停止音效，于是一旦起过风，就再也安静不下来。"

msgid "Load button"
msgstr "载入按钮"

msgid "The load window's Load button works only once a save that can be read is selected. The game keeps it live: with nothing selected a click does nothing, and an unreadable save fails to load."
msgstr "载入窗口的载入按钮只有在选中了可读取的存档时才可用。游戏里它始终可点：什么都没选时点击没有反应，而选到无法读取的存档则会载入失败。"

msgid "Turret gunners turn"
msgstr "炮塔射手转身"

msgid "A turret's gunner turns with the gun, facing where it aims. In the game the gunner keeps facing the turret, so once the gun swings toward a target the gunner looks off to the side."
msgstr "炮塔的射手会随炮口一起转身，面朝瞄准的方向。在游戏里射手始终面朝炮塔，所以炮口一旦转向目标，射手看着就偏到了一边。"

msgid "Volume of the biome music and the main theme."
msgstr "生物群系音乐和主题曲的音量。"

msgid "Volume of the weather and the world's ambience."
msgstr "天气与环境氛围音的音量。"

msgid "Volume of footsteps."
msgstr "脚步声的音量。"

msgid "Sfx volume"
msgstr "音效音量"

msgid "Volume of the interface sounds."
msgstr "界面音效的音量。"

msgid "Volume of the voices."
msgstr "人声的音量。"

msgid "Music frequency"
msgstr "音乐频率"

msgid "Average minutes of silence between pieces of biome music."
msgstr "生物群系音乐之间平均静音的分钟数。"

msgid "Sound voices"
msgstr "同时发声数"

msgid "The most sounds heard at once: the loudest play, quieter ones wait silently and come back when they are loud enough. Lower it if big fights stutter; All mixes every sound."
msgstr "同一时刻最多听到的声音数：最响亮的优先播放，较安静的先静默，等够响了再接回来。大混战时若卡顿可以调低；全部则混合所有声音。"

msgid "UI style"
msgstr "界面风格"

msgid "Choose original Kenshi skins or Meitou materials."
msgstr "选择原版 Kenshi 皮肤或 Meitou 材质。"

msgid "Speed units"
msgstr "速度单位"

msgid "The unit of the run speed in the character's information panel (the game: mph)."
msgstr "角色信息面板中奔跑速度的单位（游戏为 mph）。"

msgid "Damage floaters"
msgstr "伤害飘字"

msgid "Numbers that float over a character when a blow lands, with the damage armour stopped in brackets. Simple shows the total. Full shows the total, then armour per damage type and the part hit. Healing of your own characters floats up in green."
msgstr "命中时在角色身上飘出的数字，括号内是护甲挡下的伤害。简要显示总量。完整先显示总量，再按伤害类型显示护甲值以及命中的部位。己方角色受到的治疗会以绿色向上飘出。"

msgid "Hardware mouse"
msgstr "硬件鼠标"

msgid "Use the Windows cursor instead of the game's drawn pointer (no hover pointers)."
msgstr "使用 Windows 光标，而不是游戏绘制的指针（悬停时也不会切换指针）。"

msgid "Vertical sync"
msgstr "垂直同步"

msgid "Borderless full screen"
msgstr "无边框全屏"

msgid "Used while vertical sync is off; 0 is unlimited."
msgstr "在关闭垂直同步时使用；0 表示不限。"

msgid "World tick alongside drawing"
msgstr "世界步进与绘制并行"

msgid "Faithful runs the world, then draws it, as the game does. Meitou runs the next world tick while the frame is drawn whenever the world is busy (big fights, crowds). Always on every frame: much higher frame rates with many characters. Running alongside can add up to 33 ms of input delay (one world tick)."
msgstr "忠实：先运行世界，再绘制，与游戏一致。Meitou：世界繁忙时（大混战、人群拥挤），在绘制这一帧的同时运行下一个世界步进。始终每帧并行：角色很多时帧率会高得多。并行运行最多会带来 33 毫秒的输入延迟（一个世界步进）。"

msgid "Upscaler sharpness"
msgstr "放大锐度"

msgid "Sharpen the image after resolution reconstruction."
msgstr "分辨率重建之后对画面做锐化。"

msgid "Quality preset"
msgstr "画质预设"

msgid "Sets draw distances, foliage, shadow, water, particle and texture settings together. High is the default. Low also turns the costliest Meitou effects off (indirect light, light shafts, clouds, ambient occlusion, Meitou shadows and water). Anti-aliasing and render scale stay as they are."
msgstr "同时设置绘制距离、植被、阴影、水面、粒子和贴图相关选项。高为默认值。低还会关闭 Meitou 中最耗性能的效果（间接光照、光柱、云、环境光遮蔽、Meitou 阴影与水面）。抗锯齿和渲染比例保持不变。"

msgid "All graphics features"
msgstr "全部画面特性"

msgid "Every graphics feature as the game ships it, or every Meitou improvement. The quality settings stay as they are."
msgstr "所有画面特性都按游戏原样，或全部启用 Meitou 改进。画质选项保持当前设置。"

msgid "Foliage ranges"
msgstr "植被范围"

msgid "Set foliage visibility by mesh size rather than layer."
msgstr "按网格大小而非图层来设置植被的可见范围。"

msgid "Far impostors"
msgstr "远景替身"

msgid "Draw distant foliage using baked billboard images."
msgstr "用烘焙好的广告牌图像绘制远处植被。"

msgid "Draw distances"
msgstr "绘制距离"

msgid "Use extended object and landmark visibility ranges."
msgstr "使用扩展后的物体与地标可见范围。"

msgid "Foliage levels"
msgstr "植被层级"

msgid "Use generated simpler meshes for distant foliage."
msgstr "远处植被使用生成的简化网格。"

msgid "Landmark distance"
msgstr "地标距离"

msgid "Keep large wrecks, towers and landmarks visible farther away."
msgstr "让大型残骸、塔楼和地标在更远处依然可见。"

msgid "Distant towns"
msgstr "远处城镇"

msgid "How many surrounding zones can display distant towns."
msgstr "周围可以显示远处城镇的区域数量。"

msgid "Object LOD distance multiplier"
msgstr "物体细节层级距离倍率"

msgid "Higher values retain detailed object meshes farther away."
msgstr "数值越高，越远处仍保留精细的物体网格。"

msgid "Foliage draw distance multiplier"
msgstr "植被绘制距离倍率"

msgid "Scale how far trees and other foliage remain visible."
msgstr "调整树木等植被保持可见的距离。"

