msgid "Enable mesh welding."
msgstr "启用网格焊接。"

msgid "Shows a generated frame between each two rendered ones through AMD's FSR 3 frame-interpolation layer: nearly twice the frames shown, with a little more input delay. Works with TAA, FSR and DLSS; needs the FidelityFX library (amd_fidelityfx_vk.dll, libamd_fidelityfx_vk.so). Takes effect at start-up."
msgstr "通过 AMD 的 FSR 3 帧插值层，在每两帧已渲染的画面之间生成一帧：显示的帧数几乎翻倍，输入延迟略有增加。可与 TAA、FSR 和 DLSS 一起使用；需要 FidelityFX 库（amd_fidelityfx_vk.dll、libamd_fidelityfx_vk.so）。启动时生效。"

msgid "Faithful runs the world, then draws it, as the game does. Meitou runs the next world tick while the frame is drawn whenever the world is busy (big fights, crowds), Always on every frame: much higher frame rates with many characters, up to 33 ms more input delay."
msgstr "忠实：先运行世界再绘制，与游戏一致。Meitou／繁忙时：世界繁忙（大混战、人群拥挤）时，在绘制这一帧的同时运行下一个世界步进。Meitou／每帧：每帧都并行，角色很多时帧率会高得多，最多增加 33 毫秒输入延迟。"

